int(json.dumps({'candidate':r['candidateCommit'],'frozenFiles':r['trackedCount'],'exitCode':0,'durationSeconds':checks[0]['durationSeconds'],'qualification':str(out)}))\\n''');p.chmod(0o600)\\nbody='''The native deployment instructions still described credentials, state and real provider plans as unfinished after those operations had been completed. This updates the existing runbook and recovery owners to the tested local Alchemy commands, complete paged reads and separate deploy/read credentials. It preserves the prior source-bound deployment receipts and makes the remaining rollback and no-op planning limits explicit.\\n\\nValidation: all focused documentation, runbook, source-path and deployment checks pass, including 273 deployment tests. Complete local verification is being finished on unchanged source; its result and failed formatting attempt remain in the handover receipt. This documentation change performs no provider, credential, deployment, merge or publication operation and needs no Changeset. Cooper reviews this draft.\\n\\nBase: the agent guide delivery in draft #162. Metrics remain deferred.\\n'''\\npathlib.Path('/private/tmp/dev78-handover-pr-body.md').write_text(body)\\nprint(json.dumps({'privateQualificationScriptReady':True,'prBodyPrepared':True}))\\nPY\\ntail -6 /private/tmp/dev78-handover-whole-b-verification.log\",max_output_tokens:1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791367307.536498}}}
