{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:07:35.236Z","ordinal":68060,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac619dc8d1887d097cea6e4d448634a","status":"completed","call_id":"call_af8c7e7a6baa43c199ab3deb3aa842fc","name":"exec","input":"const head=\"d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384\";\nconst evidence=`https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/${head}/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json`;\nconst progress=`DEV-78 is ready for Cooper’s draft review in [#163](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163), head \\`${head}\\`. The current deployment, recovery, authority, infrastructure and tool instructions now match the tested local Alchemy commands. Full verification passes source \\`226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216\\` in 684.12 seconds, including 273 deployment cases, 34 workflow cases and all 14 freshly built Website/API cases. All 1,750 saved file/link identities matched; the final four documentation/task/evidence files pass five focused checks while the other 1,746 identities remain unchanged. [Handover evidence and limits](${evidence}).\\n\\nFresh read-only checks confirm all 50 Worker settings match the full paged name list, separate rate counters, existing version-seven state, active registration and four active certificate packs with an empty next page. DNSSEC and TLS settings remain unchanged. This handover performs no new cloud, credential or deployment write. Rollback and an empty repeat plan remain unproved; later provider reads do not establish a missing earlier pr-162 namespace check. DEV-77 is already In Review with its deployed guide and written five-second modern cancellation bound. Metrics, including the separate Cloudflare browser beacon, remain deferred. Retained tax results are unchanged; no merge or package publication.`;\nstore(\"dev78handoverProgress\",progress);\nconst r=await tools.mcp__codex_apps__linear_save_issue({id:\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\",state:\"In Review\",patch:[{op:\"replace\",old_string:load(\"dev78oldProgress\"),new_string:progress}]});store(\"dev78handoverIssueWrite\",r);text(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791367644.5567198}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:07:35.269Z","ordinal":68061,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","session_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","root_turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","response_id":"resp_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac619d1a92887d0bd892083d2d740ba","usage":{"input_tokens":226049,"cached_input_tokens":225024,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":659,"reasoning_output_tokens":190,"total_tokens":226708},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":36310526,"cached_input_tokens":35608320,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":165305,"reasoning_output_tokens":67648,"total_tokens":36475831},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":1272820728,"cached_input_tokens":1246631808,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":6303367,"reasoning_output_tokens":2817485,"total_tokens":1279124095}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:07:37.502Z","ordinal":68062,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-ab071335-6d7a-48d4-a24d-49be01018558","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.save_issue","arguments":{"id":"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa","state":"In Review","patch":[{"op":"replace","old_string":"<issue id=\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\" href=\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\">DEV-78</issue> remains In Progress for current workflow/evidence alignment. A follow-up Preview plan still proposes updates for unresolved peer Outputs; no replay or no-op convergence claim. Worker collection is explicitly disabled, but the live Production browser shows a separate Cloudflare-injected `/cdn-cgi/rum` beacon. Its configuration owner and privacy are unqualified; no beacon/metrics configuration was changed and metrics remain deferred. Modern prompt cancellation and public agent setup remain unfinished. Retained tax results are unchanged. No merge or package publication.","new_string":"DEV-78 is ready for Cooper’s draft review in [#163](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163), head `d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384`. The current deployment, recovery, authority, infrastructure and tool instructions now match the tested local Alchemy commands. Full verification passes source `226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216` in 684.12 seconds, including 273 deployment cases, 34 workflow cases and all 14 freshly built Website/API cases. All 1,750 saved file/link identities matched; the final four documentation/task/evidence files pass five focused checks while the other 1,746 identities remain unchanged. [Handover evidence and limits](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json).\n\nFresh read-only checks confirm all 50 Worker settings match the full paged name list, separate rate counters, existing version-seven state, active registration and four active certificate packs with an empty next page. DNSSEC and TLS settings remain unchanged. This handover performs no new cloud, credential or deployment write. Rollback and an empty repeat plan remain unproved; later provider reads do not establish a missing earlier pr-162 namespace check. DEV-77 is already In Review with its deployed guide and written five-second modern cancellation bound. Metrics, including the separate Cloudflare browser beacon, remain deferred. Retained tax results are unchanged; no merge or package publication."}]},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"save_issue","readOnlyHint":false,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-78\",\"uuid\":\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\",\"title\":\"CSF-T007 — Prepare Alchemy domain, DNS and Doppler plans\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T007` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nThe rebuilt apps need correct domains and scoped secrets without disturbing existing DNS or allowing Preview to use Production.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Read the real [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) zone, account, records, registrar and DNSSEC state. Preserve unrelated mail and verification records.\\n* Declare the retained Production zone, [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) website, www redirect and [api.taxkit.dev](<http://api.taxkit.dev>) backend through native Alchemy resources. Preview uses its own addresses and API.\\n* Use native host URL bindings and cross-resource Outputs, checked at app entry. Qualify local, Preview and custom-domain behaviour.\\n* Select Doppler configs by stage through Stack.secrets, prevent shell overrides, pass only named runtime bindings and separate deploy/runtime/query/Turbo credentials.\\n* Prepare an exact version-matched provider plan and recovery/readback procedures; applying it requires the separate concrete approval.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* The plan names exact accounts/resources/stages and leaves Production DNS untouched for Preview.\\n* Checked bindings and Doppler precedence work without exposing secrets.\\n* DNS, TLS, registrar and deployment checks remain explicit follow-ups to any approved apply; planning is not treated as deployment proof.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run check:docs-deployment:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment-tools:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment`, `bun run test:docs-deployment`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run check:repository-paths`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T005`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nImplementation is in progress under Cooper’s approved continuation plan. <pull-request id=\\\"8262d57c-a91e-4417-b8be-5c55db55942f\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/bind-native-app-plans-to-checked-source-snapshots-7028d2156cbb\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#160</pull-request>, head `c2b8f23ef3fb754f5ce1e79121f6c52044c2b830`, completes source identity calculation and protected local output writing in the existing native plan command. Checked source `195b20885c4b56e253456585864e80e5c72fd7b7` passed all nine local release checks in 951.84 seconds. All 1,742 recorded tracked file/link identities and eighteen saved detail digests matched. Real clean-checkout Preview and Production commands also passed with mock plans and 770 source entries. Final documentation changes passed docs, runbook and path checks. [Evidence and limits](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/c2b8f23ef3fb754f5ce1e79121f6c52044c2b830/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-source-plan.json>).\\n\\nParent draft <pull-request id=\\\"3c17a80a-1722-4e23-9441-02e5cc586b05\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-prepare-native-domains-and-safe-redirect-plans-2990af68e305\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#159</pull-request>'s hosted run exceeded its thirty-minute limit; it is not a successful hosted result. The bounded Quality limit is sixty minutes without removing checks. Cooper directed the full checks and native deployments to run from this Mac while GitHub credits are unavailable and authorised both Preview and Production.\\n\\n<pull-request id=\\\"58880be3-b5f2-4031-8168-97bb67eb9b26\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/isolate-native-cloud-rate-namespaces-by-stage-89fd7e3b142a\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#161</pull-request> is pushed at `580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2`. App source `787e6f72a4a2e06605290eaeb1990a360776a387` passed all nine ordered local checks in 1,038.5 seconds. All 1,744 tracked file/link identities and eighteen check-output digests matched; both fourteen-case built-app runs passed. The final three-document closeout passed docs, runbook, portability and diff checks with all other tracked files unchanged. Real cloud Preview and Production plans passed the exact clean-source/account/stage/zone checks.\\n\\nCooper separately approved three [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) permissions on the existing Production token. Independent readback preserved its identity, value, expiry and full earlier grants; the Preview token and Doppler configuration were untouched. Native Preview `pr-161` deployed at 07:54 UTC and Production at 08:03 UTC on 7 October. The existing shared state store stayed at version seven without bootstrap or upgrade. Normal app state contains both stages; old Workers and unrelated stacks were preserved.\\n\\nThe [Production Website](<https://taxkit.dev>), [Production API](<https://api.taxkit.dev>) and [Preview Website](<https://taxkitappscloudflare-taxkitweb7xvou7miucr7nekqlt7s3lct.coopercorbett.workers.dev>) pass live API/documentation checks, all three visible calculator answers, mobile search, calculation without JavaScript and ordinary official MCP client calls. Provider reads confirm exact origins, the private API connection, session classes, saved versions, hostname ownership and separate rate namespaces `10078` and `10078161`. Full DNS settings match before/after, only three Worker-managed records were added and www redirects preserve path/query. [Authority, proof and recovery receipt](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-cloud-preparation.json>).\\n\\n<issue id=\\\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\\\">DEV-78</issue> is ready for Cooper’s draft review in <pull-request id=\\\"cf1c9900-6ac0-49aa-84a5-26d6fd1cff23\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-align-native-deployment-handover-with-tested-local-operations-9525610e0f85\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#163</pull-request>, head `d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384`. The current deployment, recovery, authority, infrastructure and tool instructions now match the tested local Alchemy commands. Full verification passes source `226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216` in 684.12 seconds, including 273 deployment cases, 34 workflow cases and all 14 freshly built Website/API cases. All 1,750 saved file/link identities matched; the final four documentation/task/evidence files pass five focused checks while the other 1,746 identities remain unchanged. [Handover evidence and limits](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json>).\\n\\nFresh read-only checks confirm all 50 Worker settings match the full paged name list, separate rate counters, existing version-seven state, active registration and four active certificate packs with an empty next page. DNSSEC and TLS settings remain unchanged. This handover performs no new cloud, credential or deployment write. Rollback and an empty repeat plan remain unproved; later provider reads do not establish a missing earlier pr-162 namespace check. <issue id=\\\"61e24075-c475-4722-848e-1bdc8692054e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-77/csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools\\\">DEV-77</issue> is already In Review with its deployed guide and written five-second modern cancellation bound. Metrics, including the separate Cloudflare browser beacon, remain deferred. Retained tax results are unchanged; no merge or package publication.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L550>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-78-csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:03.765Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:07:36.667Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-07T05:17:11.404Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Review\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"infra\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"996a8e83-b1b3-42be-8416-f324bd411033\",\"title\":\"DEV-78 align native deployment handover with tested local operations\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163\"},{\"id\":\"eb6f5c31-6c54-4201-84dd-52aba255cb6a\",\"title\":\"Isolate native cloud rate namespaces by stage\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/161\"},{\"id\":\"6f2aba92-32ca-474f-b255-53600abb6f80\",\"title\":\"Bind native app plans to checked source snapshots\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/160\"},{\"id\":\"a270c72f-b405-4870-aed2-6c7ba2113336\",\"title\":\"DEV-78 prepare native domains and safe redirect plans\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/159\"}],\"documents\":[],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"assignee\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"assigneeId\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\"}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":246005667}},"started_at_ms":1791367655256,"completed_at_ms":1791367657502}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:07:37.560Z","ordinal":68063,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a115d5-3858-7ab0-9323-89edf49f818c","call_id":"call_af8c7e7a6baa43c199ab3deb3aa842fc","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEV-78\\\",\\\"uuid\\\":\\\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"CSF-T007 — Prepare Alchemy domain, DNS and Doppler plans\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"This issue tracks `CSF-T007` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\\\n\\\\nThe rebuilt apps need correct domains and scoped secrets without disturbing existing DNS or allowing Preview to use Production.\\\\n\\\\nWork to do:\\\\n\\\\n* Read the real [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) zone, account, records, registrar and DNSSEC state. Preserve unrelated mail and verification records.\\\\n* Declare the retained Production zone, [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) website, www redirect and [api.taxkit.dev](<http://api.taxkit.dev>) backend through native Alchemy resources. Preview uses its own addresses and API.\\\\n* Use native host URL bindings and cross-resource Outputs, checked at app entry. Qualify local, Preview and custom-domain behaviour.\\\\n* Select Doppler configs by stage through Stack.secrets, prevent shell overrides, pass only named runtime bindings and separate deploy/runtime/query/Turbo credentials.\\\\n* Prepare an exact version-matched provider plan and recovery/readback procedures; applying it requires the separate concrete approval.\\\\n\\\\nAccept when:\\\\n\\\\n* The plan names exact accounts/resources/stages and leaves Production DNS untouched for Preview.\\\\n* Checked bindings and Doppler precedence work without exposing secrets.\\\\n* DNS, TLS, registrar and deployment checks remain explicit follow-ups to any approved apply; planning is not treated as deployment proof.\\\\n\\\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run check:docs-deployment:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment-tools:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment`, `bun run test:docs-deployment`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run check:repository-paths`, `bun run verification`.\\\\n\\\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T005`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\\\n\\\\nImplementation is in progress under Cooper’s approved continuation plan. <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"8262d57c-a91e-4417-b8be-5c55db55942f\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/bind-native-app-plans-to-checked-source-snapshots-7028d2156cbb\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#160</pull-request>, head `c2b8f23ef3fb754f5ce1e79121f6c52044c2b830`, completes source identity calculation and protected local output writing in the existing native plan command. Checked source `195b20885c4b56e253456585864e80e5c72fd7b7` passed all nine local release checks in 951.84 seconds. All 1,742 recorded tracked file/link identities and eighteen saved detail digests matched. Real clean-checkout Preview and Production commands also passed with mock plans and 770 source entries. Final documentation changes passed docs, runbook and path checks. [Evidence and limits](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/c2b8f23ef3fb754f5ce1e79121f6c52044c2b830/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-source-plan.json>).\\\\n\\\\nParent draft <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"3c17a80a-1722-4e23-9441-02e5cc586b05\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-prepare-native-domains-and-safe-redirect-plans-2990af68e305\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#159</pull-request>'s hosted run exceeded its thirty-minute limit; it is not a successful hosted result. The bounded Quality limit is sixty minutes without removing checks. Cooper directed the full checks and native deployments to run from this Mac while GitHub credits are unavailable and authorised both Preview and Production.\\\\n\\\\n<pull-request id=\\\\\\\"58880be3-b5f2-4031-8168-97bb67eb9b26\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/isolate-native-cloud-rate-namespaces-by-stage-89fd7e3b142a\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#161</pull-request> is pushed at `580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2`. App source `787e6f72a4a2e06605290eaeb1990a360776a387` passed all nine ordered local checks in 1,038.5 seconds. All 1,744 tracked file/link identities and eighteen check-output digests matched; both fourteen-case built-app runs passed. The final three-document closeout passed docs, runbook, portability and diff checks with all other tracked files unchanged. Real cloud Preview and Production plans passed the exact clean-source/account/stage/zone checks.\\\\n\\\\nCooper separately approved three [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) permissions on the existing Production token. Independent readback preserved its identity, value, expiry and full earlier grants; the Preview token and Doppler configuration were untouched. Native Preview `pr-161` deployed at 07:54 UTC and Production at 08:03 UTC on 7 October. The existing shared state store stayed at version seven without bootstrap or upgrade. Normal app state contains both stages; old Workers and unrelated stacks were preserved.\\\\n\\\\nThe [Production Website](<https://taxkit.dev>), [Production API](<https://api.taxkit.dev>) and [Preview Website](<https://taxkitappscloudflare-taxkitweb7xvou7miucr7nekqlt7s3lct.coopercorbett.workers.dev>) pass live API/documentation checks, all three visible calculator answers, mobile search, calculation without JavaScript and ordinary official MCP client calls. Provider reads confirm exact origins, the private API connection, session classes, saved versions, hostname ownership and separate rate namespaces `10078` and `10078161`. Full DNS settings match before/after, only three Worker-managed records were added and www redirects preserve path/query. [Authority, proof and recovery receipt](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-cloud-preparation.json>).\\\\n\\\\n<issue id=\\\\\\\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\\\\\\\">DEV-78</issue> is ready for Cooper’s draft review in <pull-request id=\\\\\\\"cf1c9900-6ac0-49aa-84a5-26d6fd1cff23\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-align-native-deployment-handover-with-tested-local-operations-9525610e0f85\\\\\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#163</pull-request>, head `d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384`. The current deployment, recovery, authority, infrastructure and tool instructions now match the tested local Alchemy commands. Full verification passes source `226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216` in 684.12 seconds, including 273 deployment cases, 34 workflow cases and all 14 freshly built Website/API cases. All 1,750 saved file/link identities matched; the final four documentation/task/evidence files pass five focused checks while the other 1,746 identities remain unchanged. [Handover evidence and limits](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json>).\\\\n\\\\nFresh read-only checks confirm all 50 Worker settings match the full paged name list, separate rate counters, existing version-seven state, active registration and four active certificate packs with an empty next page. DNSSEC and TLS settings remain unchanged. This handover performs no new cloud, credential or deployment write. Rollback and an empty repeat plan remain unproved; later provider reads do not establish a missing earlier pr-162 namespace check. <issue id=\\\\\\\"61e24075-c475-4722-848e-1bdc8692054e\\\\\\\" href=\\\\\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-77/csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools\\\\\\\">DEV-77</issue> is already In Review with its deployed guide and written five-second modern cancellation bound. Metrics, including the separate Cloudflare browser beacon, remain deferred. Retained tax results are unchanged; no merge or package publication.\\\\n\\\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L550>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\\\",\\\"priority\\\":{\\\"value\\\":0,\\\"name\\\":\\\"No priority\\\"},\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\\\",\\\"gitBranchName\\\":\\\"coopercorbett/dev-78-csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-04T00:14:03.765Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T10:07:36.667Z\\\",\\\"archivedAt\\\":null,\\\"completedAt\\\":null,\\\"startedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-07T05:17:11.404Z\\\",\\\"canceledAt\\\":null,\\\"dueDate\\\":null,\\\"slaStartedAt\\\":null,\\\"slaMediumRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaHighRiskAt\\\":null,\\\"slaBreachesAt\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"In Review\\\",\\\"statusType\\\":\\\"started\\\",\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"infra\\\"],\\\"attachments\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"996a8e83-b1b3-42be-8416-f324bd411033\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"DEV-78 align native deployment handover with tested local operations\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"eb6f5c31-6c54-4201-84dd-52aba255cb6a\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Isolate native cloud rate namespaces by stage\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/161\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6f2aba92-32ca-474f-b255-536