{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:08:31.735Z","ordinal":68077,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-e0075003-829d-46b0-b0a6-90bea10d38e4","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.get_issue","arguments":{"id":"DEV-78","includeRelations":true},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"get_issue","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-78\",\"uuid\":\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\",\"title\":\"CSF-T007 — Prepare Alchemy domain, DNS and Doppler plans\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T007` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nThe rebuilt apps need correct domains and scoped secrets without disturbing existing DNS or allowing Preview to use Production.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Read the real [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) zone, account, records, registrar and DNSSEC state. Preserve unrelated mail and verification records.\\n* Declare the retained Production zone, [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) website, www redirect and [api.taxkit.dev](<http://api.taxkit.dev>) backend through native Alchemy resources. Preview uses its own addresses and API.\\n* Use native host URL bindings and cross-resource Outputs, checked at app entry. Qualify local, Preview and custom-domain behaviour.\\n* Select Doppler configs by stage through Stack.secrets, prevent shell overrides, pass only named runtime bindings and separate deploy/runtime/query/Turbo credentials.\\n* Prepare an exact version-matched provider plan and recovery/readback procedures; applying it requires the separate concrete approval.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* The plan names exact accounts/resources/stages and leaves Production DNS untouched for Preview.\\n* Checked bindings and Doppler precedence work without exposing secrets.\\n* DNS, TLS, registrar and deployment checks remain explicit follow-ups to any approved apply; planning is not treated as deployment proof.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run check:docs-deployment:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment-tools:types`, `bun run check:docs-deployment`, `bun run test:docs-deployment`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run check:repository-paths`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T003`, `CSF-T005`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nImplementation is in progress under Cooper’s approved continuation plan. <pull-request id=\\\"8262d57c-a91e-4417-b8be-5c55db55942f\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/bind-native-app-plans-to-checked-source-snapshots-7028d2156cbb\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#160</pull-request>, head `c2b8f23ef3fb754f5ce1e79121f6c52044c2b830`, completes source identity calculation and protected local output writing in the existing native plan command. Checked source `195b20885c4b56e253456585864e80e5c72fd7b7` passed all nine local release checks in 951.84 seconds. All 1,742 recorded tracked file/link identities and eighteen saved detail digests matched. Real clean-checkout Preview and Production commands also passed with mock plans and 770 source entries. Final documentation changes passed docs, runbook and path checks. [Evidence and limits](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/c2b8f23ef3fb754f5ce1e79121f6c52044c2b830/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-source-plan.json>).\\n\\nParent draft <pull-request id=\\\"3c17a80a-1722-4e23-9441-02e5cc586b05\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-prepare-native-domains-and-safe-redirect-plans-2990af68e305\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#159</pull-request>'s hosted run exceeded its thirty-minute limit; it is not a successful hosted result. The bounded Quality limit is sixty minutes without removing checks. Cooper directed the full checks and native deployments to run from this Mac while GitHub credits are unavailable and authorised both Preview and Production.\\n\\n<pull-request id=\\\"58880be3-b5f2-4031-8168-97bb67eb9b26\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/isolate-native-cloud-rate-namespaces-by-stage-89fd7e3b142a\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#161</pull-request> is pushed at `580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2`. App source `787e6f72a4a2e06605290eaeb1990a360776a387` passed all nine ordered local checks in 1,038.5 seconds. All 1,744 tracked file/link identities and eighteen check-output digests matched; both fourteen-case built-app runs passed. The final three-document closeout passed docs, runbook, portability and diff checks with all other tracked files unchanged. Real cloud Preview and Production plans passed the exact clean-source/account/stage/zone checks.\\n\\nCooper separately approved three [taxkit.dev](<http://taxkit.dev>) permissions on the existing Production token. Independent readback preserved its identity, value, expiry and full earlier grants; the Preview token and Doppler configuration were untouched. Native Preview `pr-161` deployed at 07:54 UTC and Production at 08:03 UTC on 7 October. The existing shared state store stayed at version seven without bootstrap or upgrade. Normal app state contains both stages; old Workers and unrelated stacks were preserved.\\n\\nThe [Production Website](<https://taxkit.dev>), [Production API](<https://api.taxkit.dev>) and [Preview Website](<https://taxkitappscloudflare-taxkitweb7xvou7miucr7nekqlt7s3lct.coopercorbett.workers.dev>) pass live API/documentation checks, all three visible calculator answers, mobile search, calculation without JavaScript and ordinary official MCP client calls. Provider reads confirm exact origins, the private API connection, session classes, saved versions, hostname ownership and separate rate namespaces `10078` and `10078161`. Full DNS settings match before/after, only three Worker-managed records were added and www redirects preserve path/query. [Authority, proof and recovery receipt](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-cloud-preparation.json>).\\n\\n<issue id=\\\"54c5850f-f547-48d8-9803-35e5c60103fa\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\\\">DEV-78</issue> is ready for Cooper’s draft review in <pull-request id=\\\"cf1c9900-6ac0-49aa-84a5-26d6fd1cff23\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-align-native-deployment-handover-with-tested-local-operations-9525610e0f85\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#163</pull-request>, head `d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384`. The current deployment, recovery, authority, infrastructure and tool instructions now match the tested local Alchemy commands. Full verification passes source `226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216` in 684.12 seconds, including 273 deployment cases, 34 workflow cases and all 14 freshly built Website/API cases. All 1,750 saved file/link identities matched; the final four documentation/task/evidence files pass five focused checks while the other 1,746 identities remain unchanged. [Handover evidence and limits](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json>).\\n\\nFresh read-only checks confirm all 50 Worker settings match the full paged name list, separate rate counters, existing version-seven state, active registration and four active certificate packs with an empty next page. DNSSEC and TLS settings remain unchanged. This handover performs no new cloud, credential or deployment write. Rollback and an empty repeat plan remain unproved; later provider reads do not establish a missing earlier pr-162 namespace check. <issue id=\\\"61e24075-c475-4722-848e-1bdc8692054e\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-77/csf-t006-add-remote-mcp-and-visible-browser-calculator-tools\\\">DEV-77</issue> is already In Review with its deployed guide and written five-second modern cancellation bound. Metrics, including the separate Cloudflare browser beacon, remain deferred. Retained tax results are unchanged; no merge or package publication.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L550>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78/csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-78-csf-t007-prepare-alchemy-domain-dns-and-doppler-plans\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:03.765Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:07:36.667Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-07T05:17:11.404Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Review\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"infra\"],\"attachments\":[{\"id\":\"996a8e83-b1b3-42be-8416-f324bd411033\",\"title\":\"DEV-78 align native deployment handover with tested local operations\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163\"},{\"id\":\"eb6f5c31-6c54-4201-84dd-52aba255cb6a\",\"title\":\"Isolate native cloud rate namespaces by stage\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/161\"},{\"id\":\"6f2aba92-32ca-474f-b255-53600abb6f80\",\"title\":\"Bind native app plans to checked source snapshots\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/160\"},{\"id\":\"a270c72f-b405-4870-aed2-6c7ba2113336\",\"title\":\"DEV-78 prepare native domains and safe redirect plans\",\"subtitle\":null,\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/159\"}],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:03.765Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-10-07T05:17:11.419Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\",\"name\":\"In Progress\",\"type\":\"started\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-07T05:17:11.419Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:07:36.667Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"52668f1a-675e-4632-bd34-96d6f06c6c3d\",\"name\":\"In Review\",\"type\":\"started\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:07:36.667Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"assignee\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"assigneeId\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-81\",\"title\":\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-74\",\"title\":\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"relatedTo\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"}],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":593237250}},"started_at_ms":1791367711138,"completed_at_ms":1791367711735}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:08:31.904Z","ordinal":68078,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-99b1ffc2-2514-4321-9b34-4d1adf9f2193","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.get_issue","arguments":{"id":"DEV-79","includeRelations":true},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"get_issue","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-79\",\"uuid\":\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\",\"title\":\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T008` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nCooper wants traffic and calculator-use counts without sending the figures people enter or adding consent dialogs.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Manage TaxKit Production and shared Preview PostHog projects through Alchemy with checked ownership and region.\\n* Send explicit pageviews from the website and one calculator_used event from the backend after a successful hosted calculation. Record which calculator was used, never its inputs or answer.\\n* Use a checked final field allowlist, memory-only browser identity and Do Not Track support. Disable automatic clicks, profiles, recordings and other unwanted capture; keep ordinary local/Preview capture off.\\n* Use the bounded same-origin event relay and owned Effect HTTP operations. Check the actual SDK transport, enrichment, retry identity and disposal so adapters do not count one action twice.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* Actual outbound payloads contain only approved page/usage fields, with no tax figures, free text or persistent browser identity.\\n* A successful calculation has one event owner; pure tax packages and local SDK use send no analytics.\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:09.345Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"web\",\"analytics\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-81\",\"title\":\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"title\":\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":762600791}},"started_at_ms":1791367711140,"completed_at_ms":1791367711904}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:08:32.180Z","ordinal":68079,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-62aa6305-8d02-4813-93b6-28e6cc9430cc","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.get_status_updates","arguments":{"type":"project","id":"76b26aa5-e11c-41dd-8aec-d5bd0812347d"},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"get_status_updates","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"76b26aa5-e11c-41dd-8aec-d5bd0812347d\",\"body\":\"Maintainers now have checked instructions for running TaxKit deployments from this Mac. They cover the existing credentials and shared state, full provider reads, exact plan review and recovery steps. No action is required from calculator users.\\n\\n[Draft #163](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163) is ready for Cooper review, and [DEV-78](https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-78) is In Review. Complete local verification passed, including the freshly built Website/API tests. The [handover receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json) records the exact source, failed attempts, passing checks and limits. This documentation update made no new provider, credential or deployment change. Cloud rollback and an empty repeat plan remain separate unproved outcomes.\\n\\nThe [live agent guide](https://taxkit.dev/api/agent-tools) and both deployments retain the earlier #162 evidence. Next is the agreed minimal page/calculator-name analytics. Read-only preparation found no TaxKit PostHog project or PostHog setting in TaxKit’s secret store, so project setup will have a separate concrete approval step. Ordinary Preview and local capture stay off. Metrics remain deferred, including the separately observed Cloudflare browser beacon. Retained tax results remain unchanged while the Medicare decision is outstanding; final rebuild acceptance remains incomplete.\",\"health\":\"onTrack\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-76b26aa5\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:08:04.749Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:08:04.749Z\",\"editedAt\":null,\"archivedAt\":null,\"diffMarkdown\":\"\",\"isDiffHidden\":false,\"user\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"type\":\"project\",\"project\":{\"id\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"name\":\"Taxkit\"}}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":38749833}},"started_at_ms":1791367711137,"completed_at_ms":1791367712180}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:08:32.421Z","ordinal":68080,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-cf7c651d-1df1-4d69-a28b-1319145a56a0","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.list_comments","arguments":{"issueId":"DEV-78","limit":100,"orderBy":"createdAt"},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"list_comments","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"561d87ee-b146-4cc5-b3bf-e713db4d5fa1\",\"body\":\"[Draft #163](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/163) is pushed at `d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384` and ready for Cooper review. The deployment and recovery instructions now match the local Alchemy commands and complete provider reads.\\n\\nFull local verification passes the unchanged source `226c60bddb225467db64e772d48304af2368a216` in 684.12 seconds, including 273 deployment tests, 34 workflow tests and 14 freshly built Website/API cases. All 1,750 file/link identities matched. The final four documentation/task/evidence files pass five focused checks; the other 1,746 identities are unchanged. Earlier failed formatting and evidence-path checks stay recorded. [Evidence and limits](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-operation-handover.json).\\n\\nDEV-78 is In Review; T007’s named preparation outcomes are locally accepted. No new cloud, credential or app deployment occurred. An executed rollback and empty repeat plan remain unproved. Continue the accepted analytics work; metrics and the separate Cloudflare browser beacon remain deferred. Retained tax results are unchanged. No merge or package publication.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:08:03.813Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:08:03.772Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null},{\"id\":\"b0c0d389-1b85-4be6-9ab4-b5d44e49ab0b\",\"body\":\"[Draft #161](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/161) is pushed at `580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2`. Qualified app source `787e6f72a4a2e06605290eaeb1990a360776a387` passed all nine local checks in 1,038.5 seconds, with all 1,744 tracked identities and eighteen output digests matched. The final documentation-only closeout also passes its focused checks.\\n\\nCooper authorised both native deployments from this Mac and separately approved the three exact taxkit.dev permissions on the existing Production token. Its identity, value, expiry and prior grants were preserved; Preview credentials and Doppler configuration were untouched. Preview `pr-161` deployed at 07:54 UTC and Production at 08:03 UTC on 7 October. No shared-store bootstrap or upgrade.\\n\\n[Production Website](https://taxkit.dev), [Production API](https://api.taxkit.dev) and [Preview Website](https://taxkitappscloudflare-taxkitweb7xvou7miucr7nekqlt7s3lct.coopercorbett.workers.dev) pass live calculator, documentation, mobile, no-JavaScript and ordinary official MCP checks. Independent reads confirm private API wiring, exact saved versions, separate rate namespaces, domain ownership, unchanged DNS settings and a www redirect that preserves path/query. [Evidence and recovery](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/580806576a74a57407ee266a731863d374a587d2/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-cloud-preparation.json).\\n\\nDEV-78 stays In Progress for current workflow/evidence alignment. The later Preview plan still proposes updates for unresolved peer Outputs; no replay or no-op claim. Worker logging remains explicitly disabled, but Production shows a separate Cloudflare-injected browser beacon; its configuration/privacy remain unqualified and metrics are deferred. Modern prompt cancellation and public setup remain unfinished. Retained tax results and old resources are preserved. No merge or package publication.\",\"attachments\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T06:12:54.403Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T08:15:29.343Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"resolvedAt\":null,\"quotedText\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"name\":\"Cooper Corbett\"},\"onBehalfOf\":null}],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":279453375}},"started_at_ms":1791367711139,"completed_at_ms":1791367712421}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:08:32.567Z","ordinal":68081,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-2a525d35-ddf4-412d-8ac8-8f14682a1637","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.list_comments","arguments":{"issueId":"DEV-79","limit":100,"orderBy":"createdAt"},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"list_comments","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"comments\":[],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":424355458}},"started_at_ms":1791367711141,"completed_at_ms":1791367712567}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:08:32.617Z","ordinal":68082,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a115d6-0f69-74b1-96f6-cc5176f5f2e1","call_id":"call_1f8b6cd4f54a459abf8762078283510f","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"issue\":\"DEV-78\",\"status\":\"In Review\",\"labels\":[\"infra\"],\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-81\",\"title\":\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-74\",\"title\":\"CSF-T003 — Make one calculator work through the separate website and backend\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"relatedTo\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"}],\"duplicateOf\":null},\"headPresent\":true}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"561d87ee-b146-4cc5-b3bf-e713db4d5fa1\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:08:03.813Z\"},{\"id\":\"b0c0d389-1b85-4be6-9ab4-b5d44e49ab0b\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-07T06:12:54.403Z\"}],\"hasNextPage\":false,\"newCommentFound\":true}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"id\":\"76b26aa5-e11c-41dd-8aec-d5bd0812347d\",\"health\":\"onTrack\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/project/taxkit-c6ed29d0dbd4/activity#project-update-76b26aa5\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-79\",\"uuid\":\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\",\"title\":\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T008` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nCooper wants traffic and calculator-use counts without sending the figures people enter or adding consent dialogs.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Manage TaxKit Production and shared Preview PostHog projects through Alchemy with checked ownership and region.\\n* Send explicit pageviews from the website and one calculator_used event from the backend after a successful hosted calculation. Record which calculator was used, never its inputs or answer.\\n* Use a checked final field allowlist, memory-only browser identity and Do Not Track support. Disable automatic clicks, profiles, recordings and other unwanted capture; keep ordinary local/Preview capture off.\\n* Use the bounded same-origin event relay and owned Effect HTTP operations. Check the actual SDK transport, enrichment, retry identity and disposal so adapters do not count one action twice.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* Actual outbound payloads contain only approved page/usage fields, with no tax figures, free text or persistent browser identity.\\n* A successful calculation has one event owner; pure tax packages and local SDK use send no analytics.\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nThe rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:09.345Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"Backlog\",\"statusType\":\"backlog\",\"labels\":[\"web\",\"analytics\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-81\",\"title\":\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"title\":\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"comments\":[],\"hasNextPage\":false}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791367712.617526}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
