{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:10:04.803Z","ordinal":68092,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac61a717d6087d0a7dd4fc09af09ea0","status":"completed","call_id":"call_6503bde50505472a953c65db08412221","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git switch -c codex/dev-79-analytics-policy-and-capture && sed -n '32,85p' packages/content/src/schemas.ts && rg -n 'CalculatorCatalogItem|title:' packages/calculators/src/schemas.ts | head -9 && cat /private/tmp/dev79-analytics-rendered/tsconfig.json && cat /private/tmp/dev79-analytics-rendered/tsconfig.build.json && cat /private/tmp/dev79-analytics-rendered/vitest.config.ts && cat packages/api/rpc/tsconfig.json && cat packages/api/rpc/tsconfig.build.json && cat packages/api/rpc/vitest.config.ts && rg --files docs/architecture | rg 'analytics|frontend|package-boundaries' \",max_output_tokens:2600}));\nconst p=\"Implementation has started under Cooper’s approved continuation; the old whole-design hold is superseded. The prerequisite slices are locally accepted and delivered as reviewable drafts, including the deployed agent guide in #162 and checked deployment handover in #163. Current PostHog browser SDK 1.438.2 and Distilled 1.0.0-rc.13 have been read from their official registry archives; installed Effect/Alchemy compatibility and actual transport still need local qualification. Read-only preparation finds the Cooper US organisation but no TaxKit project among its six accessible projects, and no PostHog configuration in taxkit/prd or taxkit/stg_preview. Prepare the private event rules, one backend successful-use owner, browser lifetime and bounded relay locally. Local/ordinary Preview capture stays disabled. New project setup, management credential and exact stored-event proof remain separate concrete provider operations; no provider or credential has been changed. Metrics remain deferred.\";\nconst r=await tools.mcp__codex_apps__linear_save_issue({id:\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\",state:\"In Progress\",patch:[{op:\"replace\",old_string:\"The rebuild is queued. Final shared understanding is still pending in the committed design; implementation and any provider apply have their own recorded approval requirements.\",new_string:p}]});store(\"dev79-start-write\",r);text({writeIsError:r.isError??false});\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791367793.49353}}}
