{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:11:19.858Z","ordinal":68107,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-07257421-e6e6-4bde-aa29-4c5cbfc0fb60","server":"codex_apps","tool":"linear.get_issue","arguments":{"id":"DEV-79","includeRelations":true},"connectorId":"asdk_app_69a089a326dc8191b32a3f2553f5be2c","linkId":"link_6ac0779f5b188191860fcae4d4b097aa","appName":"Linear","actionName":"get_issue","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"id\":\"DEV-79\",\"uuid\":\"85150329-9061-4690-8f80-bfbc7af57ebe\",\"title\":\"CSF-T008 — Track visits and calculator choice with minimal PostHog events\",\"description\":\"This issue tracks `CSF-T008` in the clean-slate rebuild plan.\\n\\nCooper wants traffic and calculator-use counts without sending the figures people enter or adding consent dialogs.\\n\\nWork to do:\\n\\n* Manage TaxKit Production and shared Preview PostHog projects through Alchemy with checked ownership and region.\\n* Send explicit pageviews from the website and one calculator_used event from the backend after a successful hosted calculation. Record which calculator was used, never its inputs or answer.\\n* Use a checked final field allowlist, memory-only browser identity and Do Not Track support. Disable automatic clicks, profiles, recordings and other unwanted capture; keep ordinary local/Preview capture off.\\n* Use the bounded same-origin event relay and owned Effect HTTP operations. Check the actual SDK transport, enrichment, retry identity and disposal so adapters do not count one action twice.\\n\\nAccept when:\\n\\n* Actual outbound payloads contain only approved page/usage fields, with no tax figures, free text or persistent browser identity.\\n* A successful calculation has one event owner; pure tax packages and local SDK use send no analytics.\\n* No consent dialog is introduced. Any provider event readback is proved separately in an approved Preview.\\n\\nRequired commands are recorded in the owning task: `bun run test`, `bun run test:oxlint`, `bun run check-types`, `bun run build`, `bun run check:docs`, `bun run check:runbooks`, `bun run verification`.\\n\\nDepends on `CSF-T004`, `CSF-T005`, `CSF-T006`. These will also be saved as native issue blockers.\\n\\nImplementation has started under Cooper’s approved continuation; the old whole-design hold is superseded. The prerequisite slices are locally accepted and delivered as reviewable drafts, including the deployed agent guide in <pull-request id=\\\"ebc88fb2-91a4-4b08-b8a7-503c330a40e5\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-77-document-agent-setup-and-tested-cancellation-limits-4a0a6d3df773\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#162</pull-request> and checked deployment handover in <pull-request id=\\\"cf1c9900-6ac0-49aa-84a5-26d6fd1cff23\\\" href=\\\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/review/dev-78-align-native-deployment-handover-with-tested-local-operations-9525610e0f85\\\">crcorbett/taxkit#163</pull-request>. Current PostHog browser SDK 1.438.2 and Distilled 1.0.0-rc.13 have been read from their official registry archives; installed Effect/Alchemy compatibility and actual transport still need local qualification. Read-only preparation finds the Cooper US organisation but no TaxKit project among its six accessible projects, and no PostHog configuration in taxkit/prd or taxkit/stg_preview. Prepare the private event rules, one backend successful-use owner, browser lifetime and bounded relay locally. Local/ordinary Preview capture stays disabled. New project setup, management credential and exact stored-event proof remain separate concrete provider operations; no provider or credential has been changed. Metrics remain deferred.\\n\\nOwning [task and checks](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json#L607>), [design](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b/docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.md>) and [planning commit](<https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/commit/8ed03f0e1a96d2cc258b68935b9f9be443666e1b>).\",\"priority\":{\"value\":0,\"name\":\"No priority\"},\"url\":\"https://linear.app/coopers-personal/issue/DEV-79/csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal-posthog\",\"gitBranchName\":\"coopercorbett/dev-79-csf-t008-track-visits-and-calculator-choice-with-minimal\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\",\"archivedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.397Z\",\"canceledAt\":null,\"dueDate\":null,\"slaStartedAt\":null,\"slaMediumRiskAt\":null,\"slaHighRiskAt\":null,\"slaBreachesAt\":null,\"status\":\"In Progress\",\"statusType\":\"started\",\"labels\":[\"web\",\"analytics\"],\"attachments\":[],\"documents\":[],\"stateHistory\":[{\"state\":{\"id\":\"64be05ca-3288-4616-9b5b-4d0c8d805b56\",\"name\":\"Backlog\",\"type\":\"backlog\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-04T00:14:08.681Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\"},{\"state\":{\"id\":\"b878aab7-e95e-4f74-aac1-e8693ffd9fd1\",\"name\":\"In Progress\",\"type\":\"started\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-07T10:10:06.422Z\",\"endedAt\":null}],\"createdBy\":\"Cooper Corbett\",\"createdById\":\"d8b7eeef-6a21-42af-8081-66dca85ec9df\",\"project\":\"Taxkit\",\"projectId\":\"4e0eb6ef-1871-46d4-8f47-9c8f52a9c069\",\"team\":\"Development\",\"teamId\":\"ed6b68f2-2ec2-4db2-983f-bdc5951dc79a\",\"relations\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-81\",\"title\":\"CSF-T010 — Finish rebuild checks, package versioning and controlled delivery\"}],\"blockedBy\":[{\"id\":\"DEV-75\",\"title\":\"CSF-T004 — Build all calculator pages and the fresh package interface\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-77\",\"title\":\"CSF-T006 — Add remote MCP and visible browser calculator tools\"},{\"id\":\"DEV-76\",\"title\":\"CSF-T005 — Rebuild docs, search discovery, public Markdown and share images\"}],\"relatedTo\":[],\"duplicateOf\":null}}"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"Linear MCP","title":"Linear","version":"1.0.0","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","icons":[{"src":"https://static.linear.app/integrations/mcp/icon.svg","mimeType":"image/svg+xml"}]}}},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":769736417}},"started_at_ms":1791367879088,"completed_at_ms":1791367879858}}
