{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:40:08.805Z","ordinal":68534,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac62174547c87d0accecec557c6c0ed","status":"completed","call_id":"call_2fPhE7tTJE5yRAY8BoCB5491","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/apps/api/README.md\\n@@\\n-rejected value. CORS allows the checked website origin and `content-type`,\\n+rejected value. CORS allows the checked website origin, `content-type` and the\\n+optional `x-taxkit-collection-policy` header,\\n@@\\n qualification; T009 retains safe exported tracing. The Bun commands and public contract\\n stay available during this work.\\n+\\n+## Analytics candidate\\n+\\n+`src/calculator-analytics.layer.ts` adds one application owner after a native\\n+hosted calculation succeeds. It collects only the catalogue calculator ID and\\n+name. HTTP, native RPC and the two MCP protocols use this same decorator;\\n+pure tax packages and local SDK calls have no analytics dependency. Metadata,\\n+failed or interrupted calculations add no successful-use event. A request can\\n+collect at most 64 successes; excess analytics are dropped without changing\\n+the calculation. This bounded loss does not promise an exact count under loss.\\n+\\n+`src/analytics-request.boundary.ts` reads the optional collection header once.\\n+Missing means allow; deny, malformed values or `DNT: 1` mean no collection.\\n+The policy carries no browser identity and changes neither admission nor the\\n+existing rate key. The native MCP registration omits the request collector;\\n+the older session host makes a fresh collector for each incoming request.\\n+\\n+The native application composes the private\\n+[analytics backend](../../packages/analytics/README.md). After a completed\\n+bounded response, native Worker or session `waitUntil` schedules the one-attempt\\n+send. The send owns its HTTP scope and deadline. Expected capture errors have\\n+fixed safe diagnostics and do not change the response. Off is the default;\\n+invalid enabled settings become a fixed native Config error. An in-process\\n+host has no background delivery. The retained standalone Bun host remains\\n+local and does not acquire analytics.\\n+\\n+T008 is still in progress. The focused tests prove the event owner, request\\n+isolation, policies and controlled transport. Actual built native background\\n+delivery, both agent protocols, Website opt-out forwarding, browser SDK\\n+privacy, retained provider projects and stored UUID readback require their\\n+remaining tests and separately qualified provider journey. No analytics\\n+provider or deployment change is claimed by these source edits.\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md\\n@@\\n # API and SDK\\n+\\n+The active T008 candidate adds minimal analytics only in the native API app.\\n+Its checked collection header carries allow/deny without browser identity and\\n+cannot bypass normal calculator admission. One app decorator collects catalogue\\n+ID/name after success. Pure calculators and SDK package calls remain free of\\n+analytics. The [API README](../../apps/api/README.md#analytics-candidate) owns\\n+the current bounded collector, background delivery design and remaining proof.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport json,hashlib\\np=Path('packages/analytics/package.json');v=json.loads(p.read_text());v['devDependencies'].pop('@effect/platform-bun',None);p.write_text(json.dumps(v,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nPY\\npython3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\\\"install\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"install\\\"]],[\\\"format\\\",[\\\"node_modules/.bin/oxfmt\\\",\\\"-c\\\",\\\"oxfmt.config.ts\\\",\\\"--write\\\",\\\"packages/analytics\\\",\\\"apps/api/src/worker.ts\\\",\\\"apps/api/src/worker.application.ts\\\",\\\"apps/api/src/mcp-session.layer.ts\\\",\\\"apps/api/src/calculator-analytics.layer.ts\\\",\\\"apps/api/src/analytics-request.boundary.ts\\\",\\\"apps/api/test/analytics-request.boundary.test.ts\\\",\\\"apps/api/package.json\\\",\\\"oxlint.config.ts\\\"]],[\\\"knip\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"knip\\\"]],[\\\"knip-production\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"knip:production\\\"]]]' dev79-analytics-core-knip-b\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":2200}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791369561.094588}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T10:40:08.829Z","ordinal":68535,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-ee1acec8-6025-4c53-8198-9d01b7b34875","changes":{"/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/apps/api/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -65,3 +65,4 @@\n Absent or invalid settings return a fixed native Config error without the\n-rejected value. CORS allows the checked website origin and `content-type`,\n+rejected value. CORS allows the checked website origin, `content-type` and the\n+optional `x-taxkit-collection-policy` header,\n with credentials disabled. Other origins receive no allow-origin header.\n@@ -87,2 +88,34 @@\n \n+## Analytics candidate\n+\n+`src/calculator-analytics.layer.ts` adds one application owner after a native\n+hosted calculation succeeds. It collects only the catalogue calculator ID and\n+name. HTTP, native RPC and the two MCP protocols use this same decorator;\n+pure tax packages and local SDK calls have no analytics dependency. Metadata,\n+failed or interrupted calculations add no successful-use event. A request can\n+collect at most 64 successes; excess analytics are dropped without changing\n+the calculation. This bounded loss does not promise an exact count under loss.\n+\n+`src/analytics-request.boundary.ts` reads the optional collection header once.\n+Missing means allow; deny, malformed values or `DNT: 1` mean no collection.\n+The policy carries no browser identity and changes neither admission nor the\n+existing rate key. The native MCP registration omits the request collector;\n+the older session host makes a fresh collector for each incoming request.\n+\n+The native application composes the private\n+[analytics backend](../../packages/analytics/README.md). After a completed\n+bounded response, native Worker or session `waitUntil` schedules the one-attempt\n+send. The send owns its HTTP scope and deadline. Expected capture errors have\n+fixed safe diagnostics and do not change the response. Off is the default;\n+invalid enabled settings become a fixed native Config error. An in-process\n+host has no background delivery. The retained standalone Bun host remains\n+local and does not acquire analytics.\n+\n+T008 is still in progress. The focused tests prove the event owner, request\n+isolation, policies and controlled transport. Actual built native background\n+delivery, both agent protocols, Website opt-out forwarding, browser SDK\n+privacy, retained provider projects and stored UUID readback require their\n+remaining tests and separately qualified provider journey. No analytics\n+provider or deployment change is claimed by these source edits.\n+\n ## Local native pair\n","move_path":null},"/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -11,2 +11,9 @@\n \n+The active T008 candidate adds minimal analytics only in the native API app.\n+Its checked collection header carries allow/deny without browser identity and\n+cannot bypass normal calculator admission. One app decorator collects catalogue\n+ID/name after success. Pure calculators and SDK package calls remain free of\n+analytics. The [API README](../../apps/api/README.md#analytics-candidate) owns\n+the current bounded collector, background delivery design and remaining proof.\n+\n TaxKit should publish a reusable API app server and TypeScript SDK around the\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/apps/api/README.md\nM /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1791369608826,"completed_at_ms":1791369608829}}
