{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:11:46.660Z","ordinal":69082,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac628a4e91087d0bf9dc842ddfedbc0","status":"completed","call_id":"call_566dfdeb3687443e823292ec5c569a6b","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/apps/api/README.md\\n@@\\n-T008 is still in progress. The focused tests prove the event owner, request\\n-isolation, policies and controlled transport. Actual built native background\\n-delivery, both agent protocols, Website opt-out forwarding, browser SDK\\n-privacy, retained provider projects and stored UUID readback require their\\n-remaining tests and separately qualified provider journey. No analytics\\n-provider or deployment change is claimed by these source edits.\\n+T008 is still in progress. Focused tests cover the event owner, request\\n+isolation, policies and controlled transport. The built native API additionally\\n+checks real Fetch sends after HTTP and RPC calculations and both official MCP\\n+client protocols. Each MCP conversation changes deny → allow → deny without\\n+retaining its first choice. Rejected or redirected capture keeps the tax reply\\n+successful; a stalled capture reply reaches the native five-second drop while\\n+the tax reply returns within two seconds. The controlled Node response bridge\\n+does not expose upstream body cancellation; that is not claimed.\\n+\\n+Website opt-out forwarding, browser SDK privacy, retained provider projects and\\n+stored UUID readback still require their remaining tests and separately\\n+qualified provider journey. The\\n+[candidate receipt](../../docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json)\\n+keeps focused and full-source qualification separate. No analytics provider or\\n+deployment change is claimed by these source edits.\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/apps/web/README.md\\n@@\\n provider cancellation or every failure/trace-export path.\\n+\\n+The native analytics test uses the freshly built API and a controlled local\\n+upstream with a synthetic capture token. It covers HTTP, RPC and both official\\n+MCP client versions, changing collection choice within each conversation,\\n+refused/redirected capture and a stalled reply. It uses no PostHog provider\\n+credentials or service. The Website's browser adapter, relay and opt-out\\n+forwarding remain T008 work in progress; ordinary local/Preview collection\\n+stays off. See the [API candidate owner](../api/README.md#analytics-candidate)\\n+and [dated receipt](../../docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json).\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/packages/analytics/README.md\\n@@\\n-That adapter, the Website relay and the single API application event owner are\\n-T008 work in progress. A test Layer is substitution proof, not SDK or browser\\n-privacy proof.\\n+That adapter and the Website relay remain T008 work in progress. The\\n+[API application owner](../../apps/api/README.md#analytics-candidate) adds the\\n+single successful-use operation; its actual native transport checks remain\\n+separate from this package's tests. A test Layer is substitution proof, not SDK\\n+or browser privacy proof.\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/docs/architecture/effect-services.md\\n@@\\n-T008 browser/application composition and provider readback remain pending.\\n+The API application captures its delivery service during initialisation, then\\n+supplies it to each returned request operation. Worker and older MCP session\\n+delivery use their own native `waitUntil`; request collection remains fresh.\\n+T008 Website/browser composition and provider readback remain pending.\\n*** Update File: /Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit/docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md\\n@@\\n-Next continuation milestone: implement T008's accepted analytics work. T007's\\n+Next continuation milestone: continue T008's accepted analytics work. The private\\n+backend and API collection owner have focused local proof; Website/browser,\\n+relay and retained provider resources remain. T007's\\n@@\\n-| T008 / DEV-79 | Pending T004/T005/T006 | Minimal private PostHog events. |\\n+| T008 / DEV-79 | In progress | Backend/request policy candidate; Website/browser, relay and provider proof remain. |\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json,pathlib,datetime\\np=pathlib.Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json')\\nr={'document_type':'bounded-proof-receipt','lifecycle':'evidence','authority':'supporting','owner':'taxkit-analytics-owner','last_reviewed':'2026-10-07','review_trigger':'T008 source, native host, privacy, provider or qualification change','status':'T008 backend and request policy candidate; whole-source verification pending; T008 remains in progress','observedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'baseHead':'d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384','executionAuthority':{'principal':'Cooper','operation':'Approved repository implementation, local checks, commits/pushes/draft PR and routine Linear tracking','resource':'crcorbett/taxkit; CSF-T008 / DEV-79','environment':'Local Mac; disposable native workerd and controlled upstream only','boundary':'No PostHog provider, credential, deployment, merge or publication mutation in this candidate','rollback':'Revert this candidate; collection defaults to off and requires no capture settings'},'outcomes':['Private compiled analytics package with catalogue-owned calculator identity, checked event/settings/policy Schemas, safe errors and separate named live/test services','Backend capture sends only calculator catalogue ID/name plus required operational and event identity, never inputs, answers, visitor identity, URLs or request headers','Off needs no token; invalid enabled settings have a separate checked configuration failure','One API decorator records a successful hosted calculation; request-local deny, malformed policy or DNT refuses collection without changing calculation admission','Application captures delivery during initialisation and provides it to returned requests; native Worker/session waitUntil owns a one-attempt send, own HTTP scope and complete five-second deadline; the collector is capped at 64 successes','Actual native HTTP/RPC and both official client protocols use the same successful-use owner; denied requests and metadata do not add another event','Pure tax packages and local SDK calculations have no analytics dependency'],'qualification':{'focusedPackageTests':31,'focusedApiTests':112,'actualPathLintCases':14,'nativeAnalyticsCases':3,'wholeSource':'pending'},'referenceVersions':{'installedEffect':'4.0.0','installedAlchemy':'2.0.0-beta.80','officialRegistryPostHogBrowserCandidate':'1.438.2','officialRegistryDistilledPostHogCandidate':'1.0.0-rc.13','browserAndManagementSdkInstalled':False,'nativeMcpClient':'2.3.1','nativeProtocols':['2026-07-28','2025-11-25'],'CommonplaceGuidance':'development-workflows 0.6.9; repository canonical skill baseline 0.6.1 unchanged'},'packageValidation':{'renderer':'Repository canonical package-structure renderer, effect-service variant','adaptation':'Private compiled package using TaxKit stable dependency graph, root tsconfig and source export condition; original scaffold/config identities retained in package-structure.render.json','structuralScope':'Byte-matched copy of all 16 owned package files, excluding installed node_modules, dist, caches and tsbuildinfo','result':'validate_package.py and validate_ecosystem.py pass; focused types/build/tests qualify the adapted package only'},'docImpact':[{'decision':'Change required','paths':['packages/analytics/README.md','packages/analytics/package-structure.render.json','apps/api/README.md','apps/web/README.md','docs/architecture/package-ownership.md','docs/architecture/effect-services.md','docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md','docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json','docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md','oxlint.config.ts','tools/oxlint/analytics-boundaries.test.ts'],'basis':'New private package, application boundary, exact decoder/encoder and native representation-test admission, candidate ownership and evidence pointers'},{'decision':'Preserve','paths':['packages/calculators','packages/rules','packages/sdk/typescript','packages/docs-content/content','docs/runbooks/docs-deployment.md','docs/runbooks/recovery.md','tools/documentation/runbook-contract.json','tools/skills/canonical-skill-baseline.json'],'basis':'Retained tax outputs, public accepted content, published interfaces and five inspect-only procedures unchanged; metrics remain deferred. Update public privacy and analytics operations before actual activation in the owning remaining T008 work.'},{'decision':'N/A','surface':'Changeset, generated content acceptance, new CI/deployment workflow or provider operation','basis':'Private package and application changes do not change the published tax/SDK closure; no external operation occurs in this checkpoint'}],'retainedAttempts':['Initial installed Effect APIs, raw body encoding and constructor/type assumptions were corrected against installed types; earlier focused failures remain in private logs','Initial production Knip caught a test-only exported collector limit; it is private without changing the rule','Actual-path lint fixtures were corrected to preserve the isolated config root, import format and an explicit bare-fetch restriction; no canonical policy baseline was changed','Native enabled project setting needed the SDK packEnvValue representation, and native request execution exposed missing captured delivery; both are corrected at their owners','The controlled Node response bridge did not expose body cancellation. Native bounded completion uses the existing safe logger plus measured timing; upstream cancellation is not claimed','A lint auto-fix added new to the TaggedError factory and broke the test. The test failure class now follows the existing ClientFailed naming and ordinary factory call; no lint exception is added','The official client requires legacy negotiation for 2025-11-25; its current supported protocol selection is explicit'],'limitations':['T008 is not complete: browser SDK, React/Atom lifetime, final enrichment allowlist, denied-storage/DNT proof, same-origin relay, Website policy forwarding, retained projects and operational/public privacy owners remain','Accessible PostHog read preparation lists Cooper and six projects with no TaxKit match; it does not establish region or complete paged management absence before creation','No PostHog settings are present in the checked TaxKit Production/Preview Doppler configs; no unrelated project credential is borrowed','A successful capture HTTP response establishes transport only, not stored events or exactly-once ingestion','The native controlled test observes bounded app completion; it does not establish cancellation of the upstream Node bridge or production provider work','No browser analytics, provider project, credential, stored UUID readback, deployment, release publication, modern remote prompt cancellation fix, retained-tax correction or metrics work is claimed'],'checks':[]}\\np.write_text(json.dumps(r,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\np=pathlib.Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md');p.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n\\\\n## T008 backend and request collection candidate\\\\n\\\\nContinue from draft #163 at `d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384` on\\\\n`codex/dev-79-analytics-policy-and-capture`. The new private compiled\\\\n`packages/analytics` uses the canonical renderer with an explicit TaxKit stable\\\\nconfiguration adaptation. Catalogue-owned identities, checked settings and safe\\\\nerrors separate deliberate off from invalid enabled configuration. Backend\\\\ncapture has one scoped HTTP attempt and one complete five-second deadline,\\\\n64 KiB reply bound, omitted credentials, disabled tracing and manual redirect\\\\npolicy. It sends only the agreed catalogue ID/name and required event/operational\\\\nidentity; transport success is not stored-event proof.\\\\n\\\\nThe API adds one successful-use decorator and one fresh collector per request,\\\\ncapped at 64 successes. Denied/malformed collection policy or DNT does not\\\\nchange calculation admission. The application captures its delivery service\\\\nduring initialisation and supplies it to returned request operations; Worker\\\\nand older session `waitUntil` own best-effort sends. Registration omits the\\\\ncollector so an agent conversation cannot retain its first collection choice.\\\\nPure tax packages, local SDK calculations and the standalone local Bun host\\\\nhave no analytics send.\\\\n\\\\nFocused package/API tests and actual-path lint fixtures pass. The actual native\\\\nFetch proof covers HTTP and RPC plus both official MCP client protocols with\\\\ndeny → allow → deny in one conversation, one allowed event, no duplicate and\\\\nunchanged tax replies. Controlled failures/redirects remain best-effort; stalled\\\\nupstream data ends the app send at about five seconds while the tax reply returns\\\\nwithin two seconds. The controlled Node response bridge does not expose body\\\\ncancellation; that is a retained limitation. Full frozen-source verification\\\\nremains pending at the [dated candidate receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json).\\\\n\\\\nDocs-maintainer: **Change required** for the new package and app READMEs,\\\\npackage/Effect/API architecture, exact lint admission and rejection fixtures,\\\\nactive task/plan and receipt. **Preserve** retained tax results, published\\\\ninterfaces, accepted public content, canonical skills, existing provider state,\\\\nfive inspect-only runbook procedures and deferred metrics. **N/A** for a\\\\nChangeset: this private package/app candidate does not alter the published\\\\ntax/SDK closure. No provider, credential, deployment, merge or publication\\\\noperation occurs.\\\\n\\\\nT008 remains in progress for the private browser SDK/lifetime/allowlist, relay,\\\\nWebsite opt-out forwarding, actual browser privacy journeys, retained provider\\\\nprojects and corresponding public/operational owners. Registry archive research\\\\nuses PostHog browser 1.438.2 and Distilled PostHog 1.0.0-rc.13; neither SDK is\\\\ninstalled by this checkpoint. Read-only preparation does not establish the\\\\nCooper organisation region or complete paged absence before a project create.\\\\nNo existing foreign project token is borrowed. Continue these independent\\\\nlocal parts; metrics and the Medicare decision remain separate.\\\\n''')\\nPY\",\"max_output_tokens\":600}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","create_time":1791371428.9127507}}}
