{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T11:11:46.850Z","ordinal":69085,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11571-1a58-7282-903b-860cd96057b2","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-5f6617bb-dc19-4ebb-afa8-0bf249a5eda6","process_id":"85992","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,pathlib,datetime\np=pathlib.Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json')\nr={'document_type':'bounded-proof-receipt','lifecycle':'evidence','authority':'supporting','owner':'taxkit-analytics-owner','last_reviewed':'2026-10-07','review_trigger':'T008 source, native host, privacy, provider or qualification change','status':'T008 backend and request policy candidate; whole-source verification pending; T008 remains in progress','observedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'baseHead':'d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384','executionAuthority':{'principal':'Cooper','operation':'Approved repository implementation, local checks, commits/pushes/draft PR and routine Linear tracking','resource':'crcorbett/taxkit; CSF-T008 / DEV-79','environment':'Local Mac; disposable native workerd and controlled upstream only','boundary':'No PostHog provider, credential, deployment, merge or publication mutation in this candidate','rollback':'Revert this candidate; collection defaults to off and requires no capture settings'},'outcomes':['Private compiled analytics package with catalogue-owned calculator identity, checked event/settings/policy Schemas, safe errors and separate named live/test services','Backend capture sends only calculator catalogue ID/name plus required operational and event identity, never inputs, answers, visitor identity, URLs or request headers','Off needs no token; invalid enabled settings have a separate checked configuration failure','One API decorator records a successful hosted calculation; request-local deny, malformed policy or DNT refuses collection without changing calculation admission','Application captures delivery during initialisation and provides it to returned requests; native Worker/session waitUntil owns a one-attempt send, own HTTP scope and complete five-second deadline; the collector is capped at 64 successes','Actual native HTTP/RPC and both official client protocols use the same successful-use owner; denied requests and metadata do not add another event','Pure tax packages and local SDK calculations have no analytics dependency'],'qualification':{'focusedPackageTests':31,'focusedApiTests':112,'actualPathLintCases':14,'nativeAnalyticsCases':3,'wholeSource':'pending'},'referenceVersions':{'installedEffect':'4.0.0','installedAlchemy':'2.0.0-beta.80','officialRegistryPostHogBrowserCandidate':'1.438.2','officialRegistryDistilledPostHogCandidate':'1.0.0-rc.13','browserAndManagementSdkInstalled':False,'nativeMcpClient':'2.3.1','nativeProtocols':['2026-07-28','2025-11-25'],'CommonplaceGuidance':'development-workflows 0.6.9; repository canonical skill baseline 0.6.1 unchanged'},'packageValidation':{'renderer':'Repository canonical package-structure renderer, effect-service variant','adaptation':'Private compiled package using TaxKit stable dependency graph, root tsconfig and source export condition; original scaffold/config identities retained in package-structure.render.json','structuralScope':'Byte-matched copy of all 16 owned package files, excluding installed node_modules, dist, caches and tsbuildinfo','result':'validate_package.py and validate_ecosystem.py pass; focused types/build/tests qualify the adapted package only'},'docImpact':[{'decision':'Change required','paths':['packages/analytics/README.md','packages/analytics/package-structure.render.json','apps/api/README.md','apps/web/README.md','docs/architecture/package-ownership.md','docs/architecture/effect-services.md','docs/architecture/api-and-sdk.md','docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json','docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md','oxlint.config.ts','tools/oxlint/analytics-boundaries.test.ts'],'basis':'New private package, application boundary, exact decoder/encoder and native representation-test admission, candidate ownership and evidence pointers'},{'decision':'Preserve','paths':['packages/calculators','packages/rules','packages/sdk/typescript','packages/docs-content/content','docs/runbooks/docs-deployment.md','docs/runbooks/recovery.md','tools/documentation/runbook-contract.json','tools/skills/canonical-skill-baseline.json'],'basis':'Retained tax outputs, public accepted content, published interfaces and five inspect-only procedures unchanged; metrics remain deferred. Update public privacy and analytics operations before actual activation in the owning remaining T008 work.'},{'decision':'N/A','surface':'Changeset, generated content acceptance, new CI/deployment workflow or provider operation','basis':'Private package and application changes do not change the published tax/SDK closure; no external operation occurs in this checkpoint'}],'retainedAttempts':['Initial installed Effect APIs, raw body encoding and constructor/type assumptions were corrected against installed types; earlier focused failures remain in private logs','Initial production Knip caught a test-only exported collector limit; it is private without changing the rule','Actual-path lint fixtures were corrected to preserve the isolated config root, import format and an explicit bare-fetch restriction; no canonical policy baseline was changed','Native enabled project setting needed the SDK packEnvValue representation, and native request execution exposed missing captured delivery; both are corrected at their owners','The controlled Node response bridge did not expose body cancellation. Native bounded completion uses the existing safe logger plus measured timing; upstream cancellation is not claimed','A lint auto-fix added new to the TaggedError factory and broke the test. The test failure class now follows the existing ClientFailed naming and ordinary factory call; no lint exception is added','The official client requires legacy negotiation for 2025-11-25; its current supported protocol selection is explicit'],'limitations':['T008 is not complete: browser SDK, React/Atom lifetime, final enrichment allowlist, denied-storage/DNT proof, same-origin relay, Website policy forwarding, retained projects and operational/public privacy owners remain','Accessible PostHog read preparation lists Cooper and six projects with no TaxKit match; it does not establish region or complete paged management absence before creation','No PostHog settings are present in the checked TaxKit Production/Preview Doppler configs; no unrelated project credential is borrowed','A successful capture HTTP response establishes transport only, not stored events or exactly-once ingestion','The native controlled test observes bounded app completion; it does not establish cancellation of the upstream Node bridge or production provider work','No browser analytics, provider project, credential, stored UUID readback, deployment, release publication, modern remote prompt cancellation fix, retained-tax correction or metrics work is claimed'],'checks':[]}\np.write_text(json.dumps(r,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=pathlib.Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md');p.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\n\\n## T008 backend and request collection candidate\\n\\nContinue from draft #163 at `d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384` on\\n`codex/dev-79-analytics-policy-and-capture`. The new private compiled\\n`packages/analytics` uses the canonical renderer with an explicit TaxKit stable\\nconfiguration adaptation. Catalogue-owned identities, checked settings and safe\\nerrors separate deliberate off from invalid enabled configuration. Backend\\ncapture has one scoped HTTP attempt and one complete five-second deadline,\\n64 KiB reply bound, omitted credentials, disabled tracing and manual redirect\\npolicy. It sends only the agreed catalogue ID/name and required event/operational\\nidentity; transport success is not stored-event proof.\\n\\nThe API adds one successful-use decorator and one fresh collector per request,\\ncapped at 64 successes. Denied/malformed collection policy or DNT does not\\nchange calculation admission. The application captures its delivery service\\nduring initialisation and supplies it to returned request operations; Worker\\nand older session `waitUntil` own best-effort sends. Registration omits the\\ncollector so an agent conversation cannot retain its first collection choice.\\nPure tax packages, local SDK calculations and the standalone local Bun host\\nhave no analytics send.\\n\\nFocused package/API tests and actual-path lint fixtures pass. The actual native\\nFetch proof covers HTTP and RPC plus both official MCP client protocols with\\ndeny → allow → deny in one conversation, one allowed event, no duplicate and\\nunchanged tax replies. Controlled failures/redirects remain best-effort; stalled\\nupstream data ends the app send at about five seconds while the tax reply returns\\nwithin two seconds. The controlled Node response bridge does not expose body\\ncancellation; that is a retained limitation. Full frozen-source verification\\nremains pending at the [dated candidate receipt](../../documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json).\\n\\nDocs-maintainer: **Change required** for the new package and app READMEs,\\npackage/Effect/API architecture, exact lint admission and rejection fixtures,\\nactive task/plan and receipt. **Preserve** retained tax results, published\\ninterfaces, accepted public content, canonical skills, existing provider state,\\nfive inspect-only runbook procedures and deferred metrics. **N/A** for a\\nChangeset: this private package/app candidate does not alter the published\\ntax/SDK closure. No provider, credential, deployment, merge or publication\\noperation occurs.\\n\\nT008 remains in progress for the private browser SDK/lifetime/allowlist, relay,\\nWebsite opt-out forwarding, actual browser privacy journeys, retained provider\\nprojects and corresponding public/operational owners. Registry archive research\\nuses PostHog browser 1.438.2 and Distilled PostHog 1.0.0-rc.13; neither SDK is\\ninstalled by this checkpoint. Read-only preparation does not establish the\\nCooper organisation region or complete paged absence before a project create.\\nNo existing foreign project token is borrowed. Continue these independent\\nlocal parts; metrics and the Medicare decision remain separate.\\n''')\nPY"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,pathlib,datetime\np=pathlib.Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-analytics-backend-and-request-policy.json')\nr={'document_type':'bounded-proof-receipt','lifecycle':'evidence','authority':'supporting','owner':'taxkit-analytics-owner','last_reviewed':'2026-10-07','review_trigger':'T008 source, native host, privacy, provider or qualification change','status':'T008 backend and request policy candidate; whole-source verification pending; T008 remains in progress','observedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'baseHead':'d9cadb664291b327cf3e3cb624d40c511d78a384','executionAuthority':{'principal':'Cooper','operation':'Approved repository implementation, local checks, commits/pushes/draft PR and routine Linear tracking','resource':'crcorbett/taxkit; CSF-T008 / DEV-79','environment':'Local Mac; disposable native workerd and controlled upstream only','boundary':'No PostHog provider, credential, deployment, merge or publication mutation in this candidate','rollback':'Revert this candidate; collection defaults to off and requires no capture settings'},'outcomes':['Private compiled analytics package with catalogue-owned calculator identity, checked even